  "comparison": "Warm = memory + the distilled AIP skill. Cold = neither. Those are the only intended differences and the harness refuses to start if others appear. Warm's skill is re-authored after every attempt by gpt-5.6-sol from the graph, so the skill a run starts on is the previous run's output -- runs are NOT independent, which is the point of a series and a reason not to average them.",
